text StartMessage{
    ""
}

text SignMessage1{
    "1) The game's learnsets and battle\n"
    "mechanics are based on GEN 9.\p"

    "2) Match tiebreakers will follow\n"
    "competitive battling rules.\l"
    "This means you could potentially win\l"
    "despite losing your final Pokémon.\p"

    "3) Battle RNG has been disabled.\n"
    "Catch rates, move effects, accuracy,\l"
    "and damage are now deterministic.\p"

    "4) There is no need for grinding of any\n"
    "kind. You don't earn EXP from battles.\p"

    "5) Any item you can find on the map\n"
    "directly will be inside an item ball.\p"

    "6) Trainer battles have a forfeit option\n"
    "(Run), which counts as a regular loss.\p"

    "7) You won't get softlocked unless you\n"
    "toss away items, release Pokémon, or\l"
    "REALLY mess up the Strength puzzle.\p"

    "8) Try to avoid using speed up.\n"
    "You might miss important details like\l"
    "NPC dialogue."
}

text SignMessageReadInfoAgain{
    "Do you want to read the important\n"
    "information again?"
}

